graph LR
    CI[CI Pipeline] -->|failure| SYNC[Daemon Sync]
    SYNC -->|new failure?| DEDUP{Deduplicate}
    DEDUP -->|seen| DROP[Skip]
    DEDUP -->|new| BUDGET{Budget Check}
    BUDGET -->|over limit| PAUSE[Pause task]
    BUDGET -->|OK| UNBLOCK[Auto-unblock]
    UNBLOCK -->|structured context| AGENT[Agent]
    AGENT -->|fix + push| CI
